name mouse
wait 1
# buttons: the assistive press (the mouse does not reach SwiftUI buttons in a window that is never shown)
axpress label:Starred,
expect mail.place is Starred
axpress label:Inbox,
expect mail.place is Inbox
# rows are an NSTableView: real mouse events
delivery window
click mail.list.row.invite
expect mail.cursor is invite
expect mail.open absent
expect mail.title is Invitation: Design review
doubleclick mail.list.row.plain-chain
expect mail.open is plain-chain
shot opened-by-double-click
key escape
expect mail.open absent
delivery post
click mail.list.row.receipt
expect mail.cursor is receipt
